      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, we're finalizing the pitch for the new painkiller launch. The agency wants to lead with 'Rapid Relief and Superior Comfort' to really differentiate us from the generics. Looking at the latest clinical data, do we have enough support to run with that angle? I need to know if we can confidently push the comfort/speed narrative in the campaign.",
